<title>USA: EPIX MS-325 imaging agent OK in Phase I.</title>
<headline>EPIX MS-325 imaging agent OK in Phase I.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EPIX Medical Inc said Thursday that no adverse effects were reported in Phase I clinical trials of MS-325, an injectable solution that improves the quality of magnetic resonance images in detecting cardiovascular diseases.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to begin Phase II clinical trials for MS-325 in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it is investigating the product's use in other medical areas, including the detection of tumors.</p>
